# Build context for this Dockerfile is this directory (rocm6.4.4/). Only
# patches/ is ever COPYed from it; everything else here is documentation or
# host-side tooling that would otherwise be hashed and shipped to the daemon
# on every build. Same reasoning as the repo-root .dockerignore (the rocm7
# line, which has its own context and its own .dockerignore).
#
# This does not affect layer caching: BuildKit keys a COPY on the checksums of
# the files it actually copies, not on the whole context.
*.md
*.py
tools/
